    "title": "Mexican national pleads guilty to harboring illegal aliens in deadly stash house - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Richards ,\n6 hours ago LAREDO, Texas — A 39-year-old Mexican national has pleaded guilty to harboring 32 illegal aliens in a stash house under dangerous conditions that resulted in one death, according to Acting U.S. Attorney John G.E. Marck. Cruz Alberto de la Garza admitted to conspiring with others to harbor illegal aliens... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
